4	// exported async function with all collaborators injected via `deps`. It is the
5	// "functional core, imperative shell" split from the PRD: `index.ts` keeps the
6	// one-line `Deno.serve` binding (the untested shell that wires real deps), while
7	// everything branchy lives here so it can be exercised under vitest with no
